.TH MAP_FAILED 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
map_failed \- test a mapping failure sentinel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mman.h>
.B int map_failed(const void* address);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tests a result from mmap or mremap without dereferencing it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns one for the MAP_FAILED sentinel, otherwise zero.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mmap (3crunch),
.BR mremap (3crunch)
